    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d86-a1">

                <pb facs="0189" n="93" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg93"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Secretary of State for Foreign
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Curzon</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the American
                        Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Harvey</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                        1921</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. E 12708/576/93</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: I have the honour to state that
                    every effort is being made to expedite a reply to your note No. 287 of the 17th
                    ultimo relative to the Turkish Petroleum Company.</p>
                <pb facs="0190" n="94" xml:id="pg94"/>
                <p>2. Your Excellency however will readily understand that the matter is one which
                    requires most careful consideration from numerous aspects and by several
                    departments of His Majesty’s Government before I shall be in a position to
                    communicate with you further on the subject.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Curzon</hi></signed>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">of Kedleston</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
